{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loop Loot is a relaxing incremental dungeon crawler. Dive into short runs that last only seconds and come back stronger with each upgrade. Every attempt feels rewarding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972320/extras/edb3bea4129fb47f94af9ca2feb7b5de.avif?t=1757498616\" width=616 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather loot, unlock new skills in your tree, and watch your tiny adventurers grow into heroes. Progress is always visible, and every run is a step forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972320/extras/0adb695f6b6b524fb4cc3512ab6eecec.poster.avif?t=1757498616\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972320/extras/0adb695f6b6b524fb4cc3512ab6eecec.webm?t=1757498616\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972320/extras/0adb695f6b6b524fb4cc3512ab6eecec.mp4?t=1757498616\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972320/extras/72b7488d144c937194142109d1de24ea.avif?t=1757498616\" width=616 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore pixel dungeons inspired by classic 80s games. Small characters, dark corridors, and charming details create a relaxing, nostalgic atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972320/extras/6d7036d010e1e2fa5dc1af3b6eff1e44.